        "It makes the elif check the last 10 seconds",
        "It is printed when the elif runs",
        "It waits 10 seconds before the elif"
      ],
      "answer": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "q29",
      "text": "Which value of seconds makes the lesson's rocket start the main engines?",
      "options": ["9", "20", "10", "11"],
      "answer": 2
    },
